# Private material never goes to this public repository (notes/DESIGN.md, section 4).
# The working copy is `private/` (its own git repository, backed up as a bundle in harbor-lh);
# packaging stages the part each step's verifier needs into that step's tests/private/.
private/
steps/*/tests/private/
# Oracle patches are generated from the upstream tags when the task is packaged.
steps/*/solution/private/
# Local experiments, trees, builds and bundles.
experiment/
build/
